ble-vidrio-250-ml-geometrica-smoke","title":"Set 2 Tazas Geometric Smoke 250 ML","description":"\u003cp\u003eSet de dos tazas doble vidrio para café.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eModerno diseño para preparar tu café con y sin leche.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eCapacidad 250 ml.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Blackdrop Coffee","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":51072836632858,"sku":"ATAZ1117","price":13990.0,"currency_code":"CLP","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0784\/1395\/5354\/files\/set-2-tazas-geometric-smoke-250-ml-8993783.png?v=1778077337"},{"product_id":"set-taza-doble-ceramica-150-ml-2025","title":"Set 2 Tazas Cerámica Lungo 150 ML Negro","description":"\u003cp\u003eNuevas tazas de cerámica de doble pared para lungo, únicas en su estilo.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSet de 2 unidades.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eCapacidad 150ml.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Blackdrop Coffee","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":51173997707546,"sku":"ATAZ1113","price":16990.0,"currency_code":"CLP","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0784\/1395\/5354\/files\/set-2-tazas-ceramica-lungo-150-ml-negro-4167542.jpg?v=1778077336"},{"product_id":"set-taza-doble-vidrio-80-ml-geometrica-smoked","title":"Set 2 Tazas Geometric Smoke 80 ML","description":"\u003cp\u003eSet de dos tazas doble vidrio geometricas para café.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eInnovador diseño smoke para preparar tu café con un estilo sin precedentes.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eCapacidad 80 ml.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Blackdrop Coffee","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":51256769904922,"sku":"ATAZ1125","price":11990.0,"currency_code":"CLP","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0784\/1395\/5354\/files\/set-2-tazas-geometric-smoke-80-ml-9679874.png?v=1778077335"},{"product_id":"set-taza-doble-vidrio-150-ml-geometrica-smoked","title":"Set 2 Tazas Geometric Smoke 150 ML","description":"\u003cp\u003e